891
01:34:23,688 --> 01:34:25,068
I wish success

892
01:34:25,068 --> 01:34:27,427
for all of you.

893
01:34:29,488 --> 01:34:31,328
See you next time. I hope

894
01:34:31,328 --> 01:34:33,047
to see you next time.

895
01:34:41,460 --> 01:34:43,779
Evet gençler, görüşürüz. Kendinize iyi bakın.

896
01:34:46,359 --> 01:34:49,100
Size başarılar diliyorum sınavda, hayatınıza.
